{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39409","headline":"田舍曲 · 王贞白","name":"田舍曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古今利名路，只在侬门前。\n至老不离家，一生常晏眠。\n牛羊晚自归，儿童戏野田。\n岂思封侯贵，唯只待丰年。\n征赋岂辞苦，但愿时官贤。\n时官苟贪浊，田舍生忧煎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}